     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hey guys,<br><br>When I was trying to launch my shiny app on EC2,  I was told certain packages was not found.  So I log in as super user: sudo su.  Then I typed: R (later I tried \r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\">sudo su - -c R), then used &quot;install.packages(&#39;rattle&#39;) ; however, in this way Shiny still cannot find the packages. Instead, I quited R and tried sth like:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><b><span style=\"background:#ffff00\">wget\r\n<a href=\"http://togaware.com.au/access/rattle_2.6.27.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://togaware.com.au/access/rattle_2.6.27.tar.gz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406082651000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dHl4lprOOEW5_ZVeFXqy7\">http://togaware.com.au/access/rattle_2.6.27.tar.gz</a>\r\n</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><b><span style=\"background:#ffff00\">root@ip-1xx-xx-x-xx:/home/ubuntu#\r\nsudo R CMD INSTALL rattle_5.17-7.tar.gz <br></span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><br><b><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"></span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>In this way, </span></span></span><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>shiny is able to identify the installed package. However, since often we also need to install many dependency packages, so it is not very efficient to do so. Anyone has an idea on how to properly install R packages on EC2 such that Shiny can find them.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><br><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span></span></span></span><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>Thank you,</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><br><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>Su</span></span></span><b><span style=\"background:#ffff00\"><br></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
